{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfvb2YMTRN6xfV2KC7XpD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Recommendation: don't approve the six-week study as proposed. Reshape it into a short, gated step.**\n\n**Why**\n- The bank has asked for a large, one-way change to your product, and in return it has committed to nothing: no timeline, no volume, no budget. You've spent four months negotiating, and that sunk cost shouldn't decide this.\n- On-premise is rarely just a feasibility question. It brings installation, upgrades, support, security reviews, and a second release model. Even a \"yes, feasible\" result would commit you to more cost.\n- No other customer has asked for it, so there's no evidence of wider demand.\n- Six weeks of your engineer is a real cost. The bank's legal team may also be using on-prem as a default position they'd drop if pushed.\n\n**What to do instead**\n1. **Find out what's behind the requirement.** Ask the bank (through sales) whether the real need is data residency, control of keys, or network isolation. A single-tenant deployment in their own cloud account, or a customer-managed-keys option, may satisfy it at much lower cost.\n2. **Ask for something in return.** For example, a signed LOI, a named sponsor, a pilot scope, or a rough volume. Make it a condition for starting any engineering work.\n3. **Time-box the engineering.** Give one engineer about 3–5 days for a desk assessment of architecture blockers, effort range, and ongoing cost. Don't build anything.\n4. **Set a decision rule up front.** Pursue it only if the bank commits and the effort fits a price you'd accept. Otherwise decline the on-prem requirement and offer the alternatives.\n\n**Tell sales plainly:** the answer isn't \"no\". It's \"we'll invest once there's a commitment to match.\""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3450,"cache_read_input_tokens":5000,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3450},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0d0a9d0e-c229-477a-824f-1093ee865206","uuid":"9ce694cf-1140-4711-bfe4-808e6003f5aa","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:13:15.137Z","request_id":"req_011Cfvb2Y7aWpgu8H38SsPc5"}
